    "For the paste: 1 tbsp chopped lemongrass,",
    "For the paste: 3 tbsp chopped red shallot,",
    "For the paste: 2 tbsp chopped garlic,",
    "For the paste: 1/2 nutmeg (coarsely pounded and briefly roasted)"
